{"id":"nariz","lemma":"nariz","pos":"noun","rank":1086,"glosses":["nose (a protuberance on the face housing the nostrils, which are used to breathe or smell)","nose; smell (sense of smell)"],"ipa":"/naˈɾiθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"narices"},"order":282,"unit":18,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-nariz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo una nariz muy pequeña.","en":"I have a very small nose.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1252978","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"small","l":"pequeño"}]},{"text":"Él tiene una nariz larga.","en":"He has a long nose.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38293","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"long","l":"largo"}]},{"text":"No puedo respirar por la nariz.","en":"I can't breathe through my nose.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537984","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to breathe"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}